ol] = (int)acc;\n            }\n        }\n        for (int j = 1; j < R; j++) {\n            for (int col = 0; col < D; col++) {\n                pref[j][col] = (int)(((long)pref[j][col] + pref[j - 1][col]) % mod);\n            }\n        }\n        long part = 0;\n        for (int j = 1; j < R; j++) {\n            for (int col = 0; col < D - 1; col++) {\n                part = (part + (long)rows.get(j)[col] * pref[j - 1][col + 1]) % mod;\n            }\n        }\n        return (int)((part * coeff) % mod);\n    }\n\n    static int solve(int n, int mod) {\n        int[] c = factorials(n, mod);\n        List<int[]> cur = new ArrayList<>();\n        cur.add(new int[]{1});\n        int ans = 0;\n        for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n            cur = new ArrayList<>(Arrays.asList(next_table(cur, i, mod)));\n            ans = (ans + table_score(cur, mod, c[i + 1])) % mod;\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        int m = sc.nextInt();\n        System.out.println(solve(n, m));\n        sc.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841574147809297e-05, -4.95898348162882e-05, 0.0, -2.264974000354414e-06, -0.005721027497202158, -8.821448318485636e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.3378546504536644e-06, -0.0015038858400657773, -0.0009141556802205741, -0.3169933557510376, -9.107174992095679e-05, -5.364403477869928e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -2.861018856492592e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -0.00012396997772157192, 0.0, -4.172316494077677e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00012337400403339416, 0.0, -3.814689989667386e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -0.0015434031374752522, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.023254765197634697, 0.0, -0.0041289799846708775, -